"proprietary NVIDIA driver isn't used: it breaks too often to keep the promise"
" that EvenKeelOS just works. If you need it, use Bazzite or Bluefin's NVIDIA "
"editions instead."
msgstr ""
"NVIDIA 顯示卡使用 EvenKeelOS 內置的開源驅動程式運行。EvenKeelOS 不使用 NVIDIA 的專有驅動程式：它太常出問題，無法兌現"
" EvenKeelOS「一用就行」的承諾。如果你需要它，請改用 Bazzite 或 Bluefin 的 NVIDIA 版本。"

