msgstr "如要繼續，請點擊「抹除並安裝」。如要選擇其他磁碟，請點擊「返回」。"

msgid ""
"To make one: select the files, right-click, choose Compress, give it a name, "
"and click Create."
msgstr "如要建立壓縮檔：選取檔案，用滑鼠右鍵點擊，選擇 Compress（壓縮），為它命名，然後點擊 Create（建立）。"

msgid ""
"To open one: right-click it and choose Extract. The files go in a folder next"
" to it."
msgstr "如要開啟壓縮檔：用滑鼠右鍵點擊它，然後選擇 Extract（解壓縮）。檔案會放在它旁邊的資料夾內。"

msgid "To print, press Ctrl+P in any app."
msgstr "如要列印，請在任何應用程式中按 Ctrl+P。"

msgid ""
"To record a video instead, click the video camera icon in the same tool "
"before you start. Recordings go to Videos, Screencasts."
msgstr "如要改為錄製影片，請在開始前點擊同一工具中的攝影機圖示。錄影會儲存在「影片」、Screencasts 中。"

msgid "To update now: open Wheelhouse, Updates, System Update."
msgstr "如要立即更新：開啟 Wheelhouse、「更新」、「系統更新」。"

msgid ""
"Told to add a setting by a helper? Type it under Your own settings. Risky "
"ones are explained first."
msgstr "協助者叫你新增設定？請在「你自己的設定」下輸入。有風險的設定會先加以解釋。"

msgid "Too weak"
msgstr "太弱"

msgid "Tool"
msgstr "工具"

msgid "Top bar, apps from the bottom dock"
msgstr "頂部列，應用程式在底部 Dock"

msgid "Touchpad"
msgstr "觸控板"

msgid "Touchpad found."
msgstr "已找到觸控板。"

msgid ""
"Try again in a minute. If this stays, use Save problem details in Get help."
msgstr "請過一分鐘再試。如果問題持續，請在「取得協助」中使用「儲存問題詳情」。"

msgid "Try again later."
msgstr "請稍後再試。"

msgid "Try anyway"
msgstr "仍然嘗試"

msgid "Try it first"
msgstr "先試用"

msgid "Turn automatic updates off or on"
msgstr "關閉或開啟自動更新"

msgid "Turn it on"
msgstr "開啟"

msgid ""
"Turn it on below, and computers on your Home network can open the folders you"
